OL,3,GNEWSALondon's most dangerous junctions
OL,4,Afor cyclists
OL,5,
OL,6,FResponding to the findings, Transport
OL,7,Ffor London said it was "determined to
OL,8,Feliminate death and serious injury on
OL,9,Fthe road network", adding it had
OL,10,Fcompleted work at 48 safer junctions
OL,11,Fand was investing more than #150m.
